        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KW Team Castles are proud to present new to the market, No 137 Leighlin Road\r\n\r\nA beautifully presented two-bedroom mid-terrace home, ideally positioned on Leighlin Road and presented in excellent order throughout.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned and thoughtfully arranged accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike. A particular highlight is the south-east facing rear patio garden, providing a bright and private outdoor space that enjoys good natural light throughout the day.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property is maintained to a very high standard and is ready for immediate occupation, with a fresh and welcoming feel throughout.\r\n\r\nLeighlin Road is located within walking distance of a number of Dublin Bus routes, local schools, shops and excellent public amenities such as Eamonn Ceannt Park.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended, and strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nTwo-bedroom mid-terrace property\r\n\r\nSouth-east facing rear patio and garden\r\n\r\nExcellent condition throughout\r\n\r\nBright and well-maintained accommodation\r\n\r\nPrivate rear outdoor space\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors\r\n\r\nB3 energy rating (105415434)\r\n\r\nOff-street parking for up to two cars"
